        "description": "USN-5355-1 fixed a vulnerability in zlib. This update provides the corresponding update for Ubuntu 14.04 ESM and Ubuntu 16.04 ESM.  Original advisory details:   Danilo Ramos discovered that zlib incorrectly handled memory when  performing certain deflating operations. An attacker could use this issue  to cause zlib to crash, resulting in a denial of service, or possibly  execute arbitrary code.",
